Recommends: python3-cairosvg
Description: Python library for parsing Microsoft Visio files
 libvisio-ng is a pure-Python library for parsing Microsoft Visio files
 (.vsdx and .vsd), supporting both the modern XML-based format and the
 legacy binary OLE format. It can convert Visio drawings to SVG.
